	// Branch is the checked-out branch, or "HEAD" when it is detached.
	Branch string

	// Remote is `origin` exactly as it is stored, SCP-like syntax included.
	// Turning it into something a user reads, or a browser opens, is the
	// caller's business.
	Remote string

